        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.12.21+1KI.12.22+1KI.12.23+1KI.12.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 12:21-24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Rehoboamu ku yaahikire Yerusaalemu, yaateeranira hamwe enju ya Yuda yoona n'oruganda rwa Benyamiini, yaatooranamu abashaija emanzi akasiriira n'obukumi munaana ab'okurwanisa Israeli, ngu babone kumugarurira obugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Shemaaya, omushaija wa Ruhanga, nikigira kiti: Gambira Rehoboamu mwene Sulemaani omugabe wa Yuda n'Abaisraeli boona ab'omuri Yuda na Benyamiini, oti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.28.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 28:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.28.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Mutahurura, n'obu kwakuba okurwanisa beene waanyu. Buri muntu agarukye omu ka ye, ahakuba ekintu eki niinye kirugireho. Batyo baahurira ekigambo kya MUKAMA, baagarukayo, tibaarwanisa Yeroboamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamu yaatuura Yerusaalemu, kandi yaayombeka omuri Yuda endembo z'okwerinda abazigu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaayombeka Betelehemu, Etamu, Tekoa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Besi-zuuri, Sooko, Adulaamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaasi, Mareesha, Ziifu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoraimu, Lakishi, Azeka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zoora, Ayalooni, na Heburooni, endembo z'omuri Yuda na Benyamiini ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ebigo byazo yaabigumya, yaabitamu abakuru b'engabo, yaabibiikamu eby'okurya n'amajuta na viinyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omuri ezo ndembo zoona yaatamu engabo n'amacumu, yaazihindura ez'amaani maingi munonga. Atyo yaagumya Abayuda n'Ababenyamiini bari abe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi, abaabaire batwire omuri Israeli yoona, baaruga omu myanya yoona ei baabaire batwiremu, baija ah'ari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.13.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 13:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.35.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 35:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahakuba Abaleevi bakareka amariisizo gaabo n'obutaka bwabo, baija omuri Yuda na Yerusaalemu, ahabw'okuba Yeroboamu n'abatabani bakabaiha omu murimo gw'obuheereza bw'abanyamurwa ba MUKAMA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.12.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 12:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.12.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.13.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " yaataho abanyamurwa abe kuheereza omu myanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, n'okukora omurimo gw'okuheereza baadaimoni, n'ebishushani by'enyana bibiri ebi yaakozire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.15.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 15:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ab'omu nganda zoona eza Israeli, abaataire emitima yaabo aha kusherura MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, baija bakuratiire abo Baleevi, baahika Yerusaalemu, baatambirirayo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo ebitambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.12.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 12:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Batyo baahamya obugabe bwa Yuda, kandi baamara emyka eshatu nibagumiza kimwe Rehoboamu mwene Sulemaani; ahabw'okuba omuri egyo myaka eshatu bakaguma nibagyendera omu muhanda gwa Daudi na Sulemaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
